---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Work"
  description="Machine learning, data science, and research work by Devansh Agarwal."
>
  <div class="container">
    <header class="page-intro">
      <p class="eyebrow">Experience &amp; research</p>
      <h1 class="page-title">Work &amp; research</h1>
      <p class="page-lead">
        I’m a machine learning scientist with a PhD in Physics. My work has taken me from astronomical images to medical imaging and multimodal oncology AI.
      </p>
    </header>

    <section class="content-block" aria-labelledby="experience-heading">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <p class="section-label">Experience</p>
        <h2 id="experience-heading">Roles</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline">
        <article class="timeline-item" id="current-work">
          <p class="timeline-period"><time datetime="2025-07">Jul 2025</time> – Present</p>
          <div>
            <h3>Staff Machine Learning Scientist <span class="work-meta">· Tempus AI</span></h3>
            <p>Working with multimodal AI for imaging and genomic data, including foundation model training, efficient distributed training, and LLM agentic systems for oncology. The aim is to help improve patient outcomes.</p>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="timeline-item">
          <p class="timeline-period"><time datetime="2024-10">Oct 2024</time> – <time datetime="2025-07">Jul 2025</time></p>
          <div>
            <h3>Associate Director, Data Science <span class="work-meta">· Bristol Myers Squibb</span></h3>
            <p>Worked with CT and MRI medical images on automated tumor assessment and agentic applications for clinical trials.</p>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="timeline-item">
          <p class="timeline-period"><time datetime="2021-05">May 2021</time> – <time datetime="2024-10">Oct 2024</time></p>
          <div>
            <h3>Senior Manager, Data Scientist <span class="work-meta">· Bristol Myers Squibb</span></h3>
            <p>Developed large vision and self-supervised learning models and supported AWS infrastructure for this work.</p>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="timeline-item">
          <p class="timeline-period"><time datetime="2016">2016</time> – <time datetime="2020">2020</time></p>
          <div>
            <h3>PhD Research <span class="work-meta">· West Virginia University</span></h3>
            <p>Studied astronomical images, built machine-learning models for them, and developed real-time GPU pipelines for radio astronomy.</p>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
